  {
   "id": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701@4",
   "gameId": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701",
   "displayName": "Patch 4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-17T15:02:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Climbers,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our journey continues - Patch #4 was just deployed to improve the gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks, y'all for the feedback delivered on Steam discussions, reviews, and our discord - keep it up!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Mount Everest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed camera and climbing dots map view when you were preparing for vertical climbing;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Texture fixed next to checkpoint 7 while mountain rigging;: Cho Oyu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You could fail while going towards the second camp and being on the green dots terrain only because you took a different route path;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You could skip the ice terrain next to checkpoint 7 while cutting the low corners;: K2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You could lost below an iced texture;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the first camp next to the tent there was an issue with object texture;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You could get lost under the iced texture next to the first stone climbing after leaving the camp;: Manaslu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed texture on the left next to the first climbing wall (not far away from the base camp);: Others",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dutch language added (big thanks to LazySushi for the translation help);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any issues feel free to send us game log files so we can investigate the problem:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "C:\\Users\\{YOUR_USER_NAME}\\AppData\\LocalLow\\A2Softworks\\Climber Sky is the Limit\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "to support@art-games.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for the next updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Feel free to join our discord",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AGS Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
