  {
   "id": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701@2",
   "gameId": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701",
   "displayName": "Patch 2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-22T09:28:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Climbers,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our journey began and after the first month, we experienced some issues and huge feedback from all of you - thanks for that!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now you can enjoy Climber: Sky is the Limit in two new languages!:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turkish - done by Burak AY",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Italian - done by Roberto Cassani aka Roby",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So we have prepared a patch to boost the gameplay based on all the feedback delivered on Steam discussions, reviews, and our discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Manaslu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "rock models improved next to checkpoints 1&2;: Cho Oyu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "textures improved;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "snow covered the collapsed mountain;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "horizontal view on the top;: Mount Everest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "textures improved next to the tunnel;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "battery level informaiton;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "player glitching issues on the hiking part mountain;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "player respawns after the crevassee failed without a ladder;: K2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed cutting the corner before the camp on the icy mountain;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "corrected the color of the route dots next to the base camp;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "player blocks on the hiking part mountain;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any issues feel free to send us game log files so we could investigate the problem:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "C:\\Users\\{YOUR_USER_NAME}\\AppData\\LocalLow\\A2Softworks\\Climber Sky is the Limit\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "to support@art-games.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you would like to localize Climber to your language just let us know!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for the next updates.",
