  {
   "id": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701@1",
   "gameId": "climber-sky-is-the-limit-129701",
   "displayName": "Patch 1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-23T12:21:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Climbers,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First brave players experienced this breathtaking view and huge adrenaline.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But also encountered obstacles on some mountains.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thus we have prepared a patch based on the content some players posted through Steam discussions, reviews, and our discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have read all your comments, suggestions, and feedback with the dev team. And based on that we work hard to fix all issues you have encountered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is the list of fixed bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "after falling the Mount Everest you respawned in a base camp;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "glitch on Mount Everest while climbing;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "blocking issue near checkpoint 8 on Mount Everest;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "tunnel sliding issue on Mount Everest;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "improved rock models on Manaslu;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "improved climbing mechanics in general;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any issues feel free to send us game log files so we could investigate the problem:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "C:\\Users\\{YOUR_USER_NAME}\\AppData\\LocalLow\\A2Softworks\\Climber Sky is the Limit\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "to support@art-games.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you would like to localize Climber to your language just let us know!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for the next updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Feel free to join our discord",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AGS Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
